# Installation media, if you stage it here rather than in libvirt's own image directory. Tens of
# gigabytes, and not ours to redistribute.
#
# The guest's disk lives under /var/lib/libvirt/images and never appears here, which is the one real
# advantage of libvirt over the container this replaced: nothing a running guest creates is inside the
# repository at all, so there is no `shared/` holding a token and no `.env` holding a password.
iso/
